ahanFL_%2832302420820%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/24/A1AnRoadEnd-US1nsUS23nsUS301ns-CallahanFL_%2832302420820%29.jpg/500px-A1AnRoadEnd-US1nsUS23nsUS301ns-CallahanFL_%2832302420820%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Western terminus of SR A1A in Callahan","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AA1AnRoadEnd-US1nsUS23nsUS301ns-CallahanFL_(32302420820).jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/01/FL-A1A_17th_st_causeway.jpg/500px-FL-A1A_17th_st_causeway.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/01/FL-A1A_17th_st_causeway.jpg/500px-FL-A1A_17th_st_causeway.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"SR A1A as it runs over the 17th Street Causeway in Ft. Lauderdale.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AFL-A1A_17th_st_causeway.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/46/New_Smyrna_A1A_south_causeway01.jpg/500px-New_Smyrna_A1A_south_causeway01.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/46/New_Smyrna_A1A_south_causeway01.jpg/1280px-New_Smyrna_A1A_south_causeway01.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/46/New_Smyrna_A1A_south_causeway01.jpg/500px-New_Smyrna_A1A_south_causeway01.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"SR A1A as it runs over the South Causeway in New Smyrna Beach.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ANew_Smyrna_A1A_south_causeway01.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4a/Port_Orange_A1A_bridge01.jpg/500px-Port_Orange_A1A_bridge0